{% set current_page = 'opportunities' %}
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>保研机会 · 冬令营与夏令营</title>
{% include '_ui_head.html.j2' %}<style>
main{max-width:1100px;margin:24px auto;padding:0 20px}.intro{line-height:1.8;max-width:800px}.opportunity-filters{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:16px}.opportunity-filters label{display:grid;gap:8px;font-size:13px}input,select{padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);width:100%;min-width:0}.opportunity-card{padding:22px;background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin:16px 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.opportunity-card h2{margin:10px 0}.opportunity-card p,.opportunity-card li{line-height:1.8}.opportunity-meta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}.opportunity-state{background:#fbf0dc;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px}.opportunity-state.open{background:var(--soft)}.opportunity-facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin:18px 0}.opportunity-facts strong{display:block;margin-top:7px}.opportunity-details{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.opportunity-details summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--accent);padding:7px 0}.opportunity-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:18px 0 4px}.opportunity-actions a{padding:8px 0}.opportunity-status{line-height:1.8}.opportunity-status:empty{display:none}.opportunity-empty{padding:24px;border:1px dashed var(--line);line-height:1.8}dialog{max-width:540px;width:calc(100% - 28px);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:24px}dialog::backdrop{background:#202c2960}dialog label{display:grid;gap:8px;margin:16px 0}dialog p{line-height:1.7}.catalog-note{margin:20px 0;line-height:1.8}.opportunity-back{margin:10px 0}#save-message{white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.7}
.research-direction{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:12px 0}.research-direction h3{font-size:16px}.research-direction a{overflow-wrap:anywhere}
@media(max-width:650px){main{padding:0 14px;margin:16px auto}.opportunity-filters{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}.opportunity-filters label:first-child{grid-column:1/-1}.opportunity-card{padding:16px}.opportunity-facts{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:9px}.opportunity-facts>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.opportunity-facts strong{margin:0;text-align:right}h1{font-size:25px}}
</style></head><body>{% include '_nav.html.j2' %}<main>
<h1>找到下一次保研机会</h1><p class="intro">先看面向哪届、能否报名、需要什么。冬令营、夏令营是了解研究与申请的机会，参加活动不等于获得推免资格或录取。</p>
<p class="intro">活动名称中的年份是举办年份，不一定是你的毕业届别。<a href="opportunities.html?year=2028">查看面向 2028 届的准备机会 →</a> · <a href="notices.html?year=2027&amp;route=exam">查看 2027 入学统考通知 →</a></p>
<div class="opportunity-filters"><label>学校、院系或方向<input id="opportunity-search" type="search" placeholder="计算机、人工智能、自动化…"></label><label>活动类型<select id="opportunity-kind"><option value="">全部活动</option><option value="winter_camp">冬令营</option><option value="summer_camp">夏令营</option><option value="recommend">预推免</option><option value="research_program">科研实践</option></select></label><label>毕业届别<select id="opportunity-year"><option value="">全部届别</option></select></label><label>学校<select id="opportunity-school"><option value="">全部学校</option></select></label><label>报名状态<select id="opportunity-state"><option value="current">当前线索（含待复核）</option><option value="open">已核对报名时间内</option><option value="review">待复核</option><option value="closed">历史参考</option><option value="all">全部</option></select></label></div>
<p id="opportunity-count" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p id="opportunity-result" class="opportunity-status" role="status"></p><div id="opportunity-list"></div>
<section class="catalog-note"><details id="push-panel"><summary>更新与浏览器提醒</summary><p>订阅使用上方学校、类型、届别与关键词筛选；已核验信息变更、明确截止前3天/1天及当天提醒。关闭页面后仍可由浏览器接收，是否及时显示取决于浏览器、网络和系统设置。</p><label><input id="push-discoveries" type="checkbox" style="width:auto"> 同时提醒待核验的新公告（不表示报名开放）</label><p id="push-status" role="status">正在读取通知服务状态…</p><div class="opportunity-actions"><button id="push-subscribe" type="button" disabled>按当前筛选订阅</button><button id="push-unsubscribe" type="button" hidden>退订</button><button id="push-test" type="button" hidden>发送测试通知</button></div><p class="muted">仅保存此浏览器的推送地址和筛选条件，不接收本机项目或材料。退订会删除订阅。关闭页面不等于退订。</p><h3>近期更新</h3><div id="update-history"></div></details></section><section class="catalog-note"><h2>官方栏目新发现</h2><p id="monitor-health" role="status">正在读取监测状态；静态资料不代表实时更新。</p><button type="button" id="monitor-refresh">重新读取更新状态</button><details id="monitor-candidates"><summary>待核验公告（发现不等于报名开放）</summary><div id="monitor-list"></div></details><details><summary>查看监测覆盖与异常来源</summary><div id="monitor-sources"></div></details></section>
<details class="catalog-note"><summary>收集范围与更新时间</summary><p id="opportunity-coverage"></p><p>默认不展示历史活动。届别未明确的活动会保留并标注；活动年份、毕业年份和研究生入学年份分别记录。来源超过 7 天未复核时，不继续显示为已核对报名时间内。</p><a href="notices.html">查看其他招生通知线索 →</a></details>
<dialog id="opportunity-save"><form id="opportunity-form"><h2>加入我的申请</h2><p>保存活动条件、材料清单、日期和出处快照。可以继续关联文件、联系导师和记录进展。</p><label>项目名称<input id="opportunity-name" required maxlength="200"></label><label>安排核对 / 准备提醒（可选）<input id="opportunity-reminder" type="date"></label><p id="opportunity-save-hint" class="muted"></p><p class="muted">这是个人计划；不会代报名、发邮件或自动上传材料。提醒在本机工作台查看，无后台推送。</p><div id="save-message" role="status"></div><div class="opportunity-actions"><button class="primary" id="opportunity-confirm">保存项目</button><button type="button" id="opportunity-cancel">取消</button></div></form></dialog>
</main><script src="opportunities-data.js?v=20261115-4"></script><script src="opportunities-core.js?v=20261115-3"></script><script src="opportunities.js?v=20261115-5"></script><script src="opportunity-push.js?v=20261115-3"></script><script src="browser-library-core.js?v=20261115-5"></script><script src="browser-library.js?v=20261115-5"></script></body></html>
